<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak cbank to end forex limits for citizens.</title>
<headline>Slovak cbank to end forex limits for citizens.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday it had approved a draft law effectively allowing Slovak branches of foreign banks to buy real estate in Slovakia.</p>
<p>It also said in a statement that it had proposed ending the current 60,000 crown annual limit on foreign currency purchases by citizens.</p>
</text>
